{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c2169041d4be8582209a83ab4377e5590212ea1206a8f4e15c4cce3be566361e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe2c421ddda060c408fc36da568684b3c5343e226f224b12805c03cc610de405",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n现在正在休息中吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17ca50788e8c57c64cd9607204615f4fc5047503d39dcfe6070fd6a4cec9c9c5",
      "text": "是的。方便的话，要不要一起休息一下呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:216f50d2a1794e63273635698d8e4613cd22b052eec61cad3a99e5f80d4bcdbc",
      "text": "呵呵，刚才我也正想着说同样的话呢。\n休息时来杯咖啡相伴觉得如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:419a9a223da5a818334f895ebd757b43708602df4ee2ff5be4e6749114983674",
      "text": "那我就不客气地享用啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab32d2851c873e7880bd3e1c19fdb599c016d129f74287582debf784edf787fd",
      "text": "那么我去冲泡。请稍等片刻哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfd8d523253c2635445dd9b181f191b7edfcf9fad6f4304d5ce43add59f4d370",
      "text": "让您久等了。\n这杯咖啡，是白色情人节的回礼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9909c56b8c2e70956e9c31e15b55d447bce498b89d74613c0fab342a80f112ce",
      "text": "是与之前您来我家做客时冲泡的\n不同种类的咖啡豆。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ea5e656482ce394be5eee2e28eb378bd2daebf76a51b787f13819d0c23ce402",
      "text": "是我去海外时\n尝了一口就非常中意的品种。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed8ceb437ad7c1a14ea4e8ea585cb4125c02e37053cf9f922060c61b07a88419",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。香气也非常浓郁诱人呢。\n那么我就开动了。……嗯，真好喝！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07c97194c84bacffb209b473452479cf9e874c76e2712846c02db585f7275758",
      "text": "太好啦！\n还有咖啡豆，待会儿送给您哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_23_5_02_006_23:5_02_006_23:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e86d721930357724d6559ff9ee098e4aabc73044fd7d8f1ce6c89810e41e765",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n回了家我也能继续好好享用了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
